# Machine-readable metadata (English). Human-readable guides: CITATION_EN.md / CITATION_CN.md
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FigTreeKit-MCP in your work, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "FigTreeKit-MCP: An MCP server for AI-driven FigTreeKit phylogenetic tree styling"
abstract: >-
  FigTreeKit-MCP is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes the
  FigTreeKit phylogenetic-tree workflow (validate, analyze, style, export and
  render) to AI assistants. Styling and export calls return reproducible
  figtreekit command lines and FigTree configuration blocks, and file access is
  confined to a writable workspace plus optional read-only roots.
